ct, or the true founder behind the Kiefer-Hall / Cutler Biotech biological line), or a "deceased" VIP whose biological samples funded Cutler Biotech's original patents?Why Did Victor Garroway Frame Tessa in 2023 Instead of Killing Her?Garroway knew Tessa's father took the carbon copy of the 1998 offload log and the spare WARD C key before dying of a "coronary." Destroying Tessa's career and financially squeezing her in Portland was designed both to discredit her if she ever found the 2023 wharf link AND to flush out whichever Calder sister held the 1998 key and carbon sheet.Margot Kiefer-Hall on Bail:In Chapter 23 of Book 2, Margot posted a $500,000 surety bond in Burlington and vanished behind appellate motions—meaning both Victor Garroway and Margot Kiefer-Hall are still on the board for the Book 3 endgame.
